{
  "name": "炸药",
  "icon": "bloodmagic:shaped_charge",
  "category": "bloodmagic:demon_will/demonic_items",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "对于那些不愿有远大梦想的人来说，采矿和种树都是好事，但有自尊心的血魔法师会堕落到那种地步吗？$(br2)考虑到这一点，你设计了一些狡猾的小东西。只要把它们扔在讨厌的树、石头或任何你想破坏的东西上，然后等着它们自爆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "不仅如此，还可以搭配特定的材料和一点$(raw)意志$()为其$(item)涂油$()，以提升其功效，详细描述位于各条目之后。$(br2)目前可用的涂油效果如下：$(li)好运 —— 被破坏的方块会受到$(thing)时运$()效果影响。$(li)高温工具 —— 被破坏的方块会被$(thing)熔炼$()。$(li)柔触 —— 被破坏的方块会受到$(thing)精准采集$()效果影响。$(li)虚化 —— 直接“销毁”方块而不产生掉落物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "固形炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge",
      "anchor": "shaped_charge",
      "text": "$(item)固形炸药$()会破坏其附着方向上5x5x5正方体范围内的方块，相当于使用镐挖掘这些方块。它甚至可以用来挖掘黑曜石，并且产生令人喜闻乐见的$(o)巨大爆炸声$()。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "虚化",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_voiding",
      "b.heading": "高温工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_smelting",
      "c.heading": "柔触",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_silk_touch"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "好运",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_fortune_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "增强固形炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge",
      "anchor": "shaped_charge_2",
      "text": "$(item)增强固形炸药$()是固形炸药的直接升级版，可以破坏其附着方向上7x7x7正方体范围内的方块，相当于使用镐挖掘这些方块。还可以用油为其涂覆$(thing)时运 II$()的效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "虚化",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge_voiding",
      "b.heading": "高温工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge_smelting_l",
      "c.heading": "柔触",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge_silk_touch_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:2x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "好运",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge_fortune_1_l",
      "b.heading": "好运 II",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/aug_shaped_charge_fortune_2_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "凿隧固形炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge",
      "anchor": "shaped_charge_tunneling",
      "text": "$(item)凿隧固形炸药$()会破坏其附着方向上5x5x20范围内的方块，相当于使用镐挖掘这些方块，在挖矿时很实用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "虚化",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_deep_voiding",
      "b.heading": "高温工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_deep_smelting_l",
      "c.heading": "柔触",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_deep_silk_touch_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:2x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "好运",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_deep_fortune_1_l",
      "b.heading": "好运 II",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/shaped_charge_deep_fortune_2_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "采伐炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge",
      "anchor": "deforester_charge",
      "text": "$(item)采伐炸药$()适用于砍树，可以破坏原木和树叶。除了最强大的树，其余所有树木都会直接倒下，最多一次性破坏$(item)两组$()原木（同时干净利落地破坏遇到的所有树叶！）即使是雨林里的巨树也会在几秒钟内倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "虚化",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_voiding",
      "b.heading": "高温工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_smelting",
      "c.heading": "柔触",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_silk_touch"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "好运",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_fortune_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "采伐炸药 II",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_2",
      "anchor": "deforester_charge_2",
      "text": "$(item)采伐炸药 II$()与采伐炸药相似，都可以破坏树木，它最多可以破坏8x64个原木，并清理掉所有与之相连的树叶。非常适合在深色橡树林或雨林中为自己开辟一片漂亮的空地，或许，你可能恰好喜欢它炸出来的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "虚化",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_voiding",
      "b.heading": "高温工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_2_smelting_l",
      "c.heading": "柔触",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_2_silk_touch_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:2x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "好运",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_2_fortune_1_l",
      "b.heading": "好运 II",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/deforester_charge_2_fortune_2_l"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "可控炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/vein_charge",
      "anchor": "controlled_charge",
      "text": "$(item)可控炸药$()只会破坏$(thing)与之附着的方块相同的方块$()，最多破坏3组相应方块，从其爆炸点开始搜索。相比于其他炸药，所有被其破坏的方块都会掉落。"
    },
    {
